{"product_id":"total-development-program-knowledge-series-volumes-1-24","title":"Total Development Program – Knowledge Series (Volumes 1–24)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"693\"\u003eIntroduce your child to a world of knowledge with the Total Development Program – Knowledge Series. This carefully structured 24-volume collection is designed to nurture curiosity, build understanding, and encourage exploration across multiple subjects. Each volume takes children on a journey of discovery, from learning about themselves and life, to understanding nature, science, and the world around them.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"743\"\u003eThe series is divided into four thematic sets:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"811\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"811\"\u003eLife 1–6: Exploring personal growth, health, habits, and values\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"877\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"877\"\u003eNature 7–12: Discovering plants, animals, and the environment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"965\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"965\"\u003eScience 13–18: Understanding basic scientific concepts, experiments, and principles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003eOur World 19–24: Learning about geography, cultures, communities, and global awareness\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1346\"\u003eThrough engaging stories, colorful illustrations, and interactive activities, children are encouraged to ask questions, think critically, and develop a lifelong love for learning. The series is suitable for children aged 3–10 and supports foundational knowledge and cognitive development.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003eTitle: Total Development Program – Knowledge Series (Volumes 1–24)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1498\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1548\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1746\"\u003eSeries Themes: Life (1–6), Nature (7–12), Science (13–18), Our World (19–24)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809428922521,"sku":"9RA98765","price":450.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_191003.jpg?v=1761059850","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/total-development-program-knowledge-series-volumes-1-24","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}